flowchart TD
  Need[Besoin email] --> Inbound{Entrant ?}
  Inbound -->|Oui| Routing[Cloudflare Email Routing]
  Routing --> Workflow{Traitement necessaire ?}
  Workflow -->|Oui| Worker[Email Worker vers Queue / D1 / R2]
  Workflow -->|Non| Forward[Transfert vers boite humaine]
  Inbound -->|Non| Outbound{Type sortant ?}
  Outbound -->|Transactionnel| Transactional[Resend ou Postmark]
  Outbound -->|Marketing| Marketing[Loops / Customer.io]
  Outbound -->|Brouillon agent| Approval[Politique app et approbation]
  Approval --> Transactional
